                "comment": "Charles is the professor we all need. Our classes were two hours long yet time seemed to fly by because of how entertaining he is. He provided amazing feedback on even small homework assignments. He is very understanding about extensions and is someone who simply raises our confidence when we make mistakes. Also, brought us snacks every week :)",
